## 아키텍처

### 5계층 구조

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Layer 5: API (REST + WebSocket)    │
│  /dashboard, /api/query, /metrics   │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Layer 4: Server (HTTP + WS)        │
│  Request Routing, Response Handling │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Layer 3: Visualization             │
│  Charts, Dashboard, Panels          │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Layer 2: Query & Alerting          │
│  KimQL Engine, Alert Rules          │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Layer 1: Data (TSDB + Storage)     │
│  Ring Buffer, Segments, File I/O    │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 13개 모듈

```
Core (2,600줄):
  ├─ tsdb.fl (700줄) - Ring buffer time-series
  ├─ query_engine.fl (500줄) - KimQL parser
  ├─ storage.fl (400줄) - 세그먼트 저장소
  └─ mod.fl (100줄) - 모듈 통합

Sources (1,000줄):
  ├─ phase7_source.fl (300줄)
  ├─ mesh_source.fl (300줄)
  └─ prometheus.fl (400줄)

UI (1,500줄):
  ├─ chart_engine.fl (600줄)
  ├─ dashboard.fl (500줄)
  └─ panel.fl (400줄)

Alerts (700줄):
  ├─ rule_engine.fl (400줄)
  └─ notifier.fl (300줄)

Server (500줄):
  └─ server.fl - HTTP/WebSocket
```

